<title>UK: SBC sets warrants on German chemical basket.</title>
<headline>SBC sets warrants on German chemical basket.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schweizerischer Bankverein (Deutschland) AG has issued one million American-style call warrants, on a German chemical basket, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>The basket includes 10 BASF AG shares, 10 Bayer AG shares and 10 Hoechst AG shares.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1800 DEM		  PREMIUM	9.65 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     6.40 DEM		  GEARING	26.56 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 19.NOV.96-01.JUL.97   PAYDATE	18.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   FRFT, DUSS		MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
